---
description: Alembic migrations must be autogenerated only
globs: src/alembic/**/*
alwaysApply: false
---

# No manual migrations

- Create revisions only via `pnpm run db:make "message"` (Alembic `--autogenerate`).
- Do not hand-write or paste migration files into `src/alembic/versions/`.
- Ensure new tables are imported from `src/models/__init__.py` before generating.
